---
# Panel numbers start again on each page; each @over: names a panel on its own page.
cast: {ALICE: {reference: alice}}
---
PAGE ONE

PANEL 1
@cast: {BOB: {reference: bob}}
BOB
Hi.

PANEL 2
@over: 1
BOB
Still me.

PAGE TWO

PANEL 1
@cast: {CAROL: {reference: alice}}
CAROL
Hello.

PANEL 2
@over: 1
CAROL
Again.
